# Manifests Directory

This directory stores fixity manifests and their cryptographic signatures.

## Contents

- `fixity_manifest_*.txt` — State snapshots of the Codex directory
- `fixity_manifest_*.txt.sig` — EDDSA signatures verifying authenticity

## Usage

Manifests are generated on a fixed schedule and serve as baseline records
for drift detection. Each manifest captures the state at a specific timestamp.

## Verification

```bash
# Verify signature
openssl dgst -sha256 -verify pub.pem -signature manifest.sig manifest.txt

# Compare hash
sha256sum manifest.txt
```
